  "containers": {
    "passiveCard": "<div id=\"card-sec-1\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-1\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">Activates the Entrance Animation when there is another \"Z Heroes\" Category ally on the team upon the character's entry</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-1\"><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Launches an additional Super Attack and \"Z Hereos\" allies' Ki +2 and ATK &amp; DEF 59%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Damage reduction rate 21%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">for 1 turn</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-2\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-2\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">Basic effect(s)</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-2\"><li>Ki +5</li><li>Guards all attacks</li><li>ATK &amp; DEF 459%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li>Damage reduction rate up 59%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li>Receives an additional Ki +2 per Ki Sphere obtained</li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Activates K.O. Guard when an ally is defeated (once only)</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-3\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-3\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">For every attack received by allies</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-3\"><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">ATK 50%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"> (up to 259%)</li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">\"Super Class\" allies' DEF 10%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">(up to 59%) (self excluded)</li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Chance of performing critical hit 10%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">(up to 59%)</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-4\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-4\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">When attacking</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-4\"><li>ATK 159%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li>Attack effective against all types</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-5\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-5\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">For every attack received</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-5\"><li>ATK 59%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">within the turn</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-6\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-6\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">When an ally is defeated in battle</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-6\"><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Activate K.O. Guard</li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Recover 59% HP</li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">All allies' DEF 59%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-7\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-7\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">When the character is KO'd</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-7\"><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">Revives with 59% HP</li><li><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"><img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_icon_02.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">ATK &amp; DEF 159%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-8\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-8\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">When there is an ally whose name includes \"Krillin\" on the team</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-8\"><li class=\"\">ATK &amp; DEF 159%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\"></li><li>Foresees enemy's Super Attack</li><li>Launches an additional Super Attack</li></ul></div><div id=\"card-sec-9\"><strong id=\"card-header-text-9\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px;\">When receiving a Ki Blast Super Attack</strong><ul id=\"card-ul-9\" class=\"\"><li class=\"\">Nullifies it, ATK 359%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">temporarily and counters with tremendous power when facing an extreme class enemy</li><li class=\"\">Great chance of nullifying it, ATK 259%<img src=\"https://abscustom.github.io/assets/images/passive_skill_dialog_arrow01.png\" style=\"height:14px; vertical-align:middle; margin:0 2px; transform:translateY(-1.5px);\">temporarily and countering with tremendous power</li></ul></div>",
